  Worktree porcelain: `M cli/cmd_more.oo`, `M cli/main.oo`,
  `?? scripts/bench_smoke.oo`.
  This role wrote only this audit note.
  Did not edit `/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/ooda`.
