  No new `.py`, `.md`, or `.sh`.
  `bin/ooda` is absent. Live binary strings are INT.

## 6. Residual (not FAIL)

  `sys_exec(..., "sh", "-c", ...)` remains. It is the host_run helper.
  The script is env plus oodac plus `check` or `run` plus `sq(path)`.
  LLVM TimeCap grant is still residual. Product path is C emit plus gcc.

Status: Wave 3 SEC is PASS. Ship 3 stays open for PV, MEM, and INT.

C emit plus gcc remains the product path.
